:: StoryTitle
DCC


:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "75E9DFA1-99A5-45F7-8168-5F1D09B9E008",
  "format": "Harlowe",
  "format-version": "3.3.9",
  "start": "Beginning",
  "zoom": 1
}


:: \ Continue Straight {"position":"1025,1275","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $health = $health - $bleedRate)
(set: $progress = $progress + 2)
(if: $seeMetrics)[
	HP: $health <br/>
    Bleed Rate: $bleedRate <br/>
    Attack Strength: $attack <br/>
    Mobility: $mobility <br/>
]
(if: $health < 1)[
	You have lost too much blood. The world begins to grow faint as you feel a deep hunger grow... <br/>
    [[Game Over]]
] (else-if: $progress > 99)[
	You see the exit up ahead. You can finally make your escape! <br/>
    [[Exit the Building]] <br/>
    [[Enter a Nearby Room]] 
] (else-if: (random:0,100) < 15)[
	You begin to feel faint and nauseous... <br/>
    There is an examination room nearby <br/>
    [[Enter Examination Room]]
    [[Lie Down and Rest For a Bit (I don't think you will survive this)->Game Over]] 
] (else:)[
	(if: (random:0,100) < 33)[
    	You approach an intersection of hallways <br/>
        [[Turn Left]] <br/>
        [[Turn Right]] <br/>
 	]
    [[ Continue Straight]]  <br/>
    [[Enter a Nearby Room]]
    (if: (random:0,100) < $karma / 2)[
    	There is also a stairwell to go down a few floors <br/>
        [[Go Down]]
    ]
]
}


:: Beginning {"position":"900,375","size":"100,100"}
You work at the top floor of the hospital as an orthopaedic surgeon. One day, while performing surgery, the power goes out in the building. You continue work under the backgup generator, but you begin to hear screams in the distance.

[[Continue with the operation]]
[[Go Investigate]]

(set: $health = 100)
(set: $karma = 50)
(set: $mobility = 80)
(set: $infectionChance = 0)
(set: $bleedRate = 0)
(set: $progress = 0)
(set: $attack = 5)

(set: $seeMetrics = false)


:: Continue with the operation {"position":"900,500","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $karma = $karma + 25)

You cannot abandon the patient in the middle of an operation. You complete the hip replacement surgery as the noises become increasingly distressing. You are just sewing the patient up when you hear crashing noises and more screams very near the room you are in. 
<br/>
[[Enter the Hallway]]
}


:: Enter Examination Room {"position":"1425,1225","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $health = $health - $bleedRate)
(set: $progress = $progress + 2)
(if: $seeMetrics)[
	HP: $health <br/>
    Bleed Rate: $bleedRate <br/>
    Attack Strength: $attack <br/>
    Mobility: $mobility <br/>
]
(if: $health < 1)[
	You have lost too much blood. The world begins to grow faint as you feel a deep hunger grow... <br/>
    [[Game Over]]
] (else:)[
	$limbLost = (random:1,4)
    (if: $limbLost = 1)[
    	Leg
    ] (else-if: $limbLost = 2)[
    	Arm
    ] (else-if: $limbLost = 2)[
    	Eye
    ] (else-if: $limbLost = 2)[
    	Heart
    ]
] 
}


:: Enter a Nearby Room {"position":"775,1125","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $health = $health - $bleedRate)
(set: $progress = $progress + 1)
(if: $seeMetrics)[
	HP: $health <br/>
    Bleed Rate: $bleedRate <br/>
    Attack Strength: $attack <br/>
    Mobility: $mobility <br/>
]
(if: $health < 1)[
	You have lost too much blood. The world begins to grow faint as you feel a deep hunger grow... 
] (else:)[
	(if: (random:0,100) < 30)[
    	You find a patient bleeding out on the floor of the room! There are medical supplied around the room to help stop bleeding.<br/>
        [[Help Them]]
        [[Use the Supplies on Yourself]]
    ]
]
}


:: Enter the Hallway {"position":"950,750","size":"100,100"}
{
(if: (random: 0,100) > $karma)[
There are zombies in the hallway! They smell you and begin to come after you. <br/>
[[Fight Past Them]] <br/>
[[Flee]]

] (else:) [
You do not see anything but a dark hallway. <br/>
[[Continue -> Continue Straight]]
]
}


:: Exit the Building {"position":"1075,1600","size":"100,100"}



:: Fight Past Them {"position":"887.5,875","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $progress = $progress + 2)
(set: $damageTaken = ($mobility + ($damage * 3)) / 50 * (random: 0,3))
(if: $damageTaken > 5)[
	(set: $bleedRate = $bleedRate + 1)
]
(set: $health = $health - $damageTaken)
(if: $seeMetrics)[
	HP: $health <br/>
    Bleed Rate: $bleedRate <br/>
    Damage Taken: $damageTaken <br/>
]

(if: $health < 1)[
	You have lost too much blood. The world begins to grow faint as you feel a deep hunger grow... <br/>
    [[Game Over]]
] (else:)[
 	You manage to fight you way past. 
 	(if: $damageTaken)[
    	 You didn't get through unscathed though. 
    ] <br/>
 	(if: (random:0,100) < 33)[
    	You approach an intersection of hallways <br/>
        [[Turn Left]] <br/>
        [[Turn Right]] <br/>
 	]
    [[ Continue Straight]]  <br/>
    [[Enter a Nearby Room]]
]
}


:: Flee {"position":"1012.5,875","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $progress = $progress + 1)
(set: $caught = $mobility / 2.5 < (random: 0,40))
(if: $caught)[
	You attempt to flee but you were clumsy and got caught, recieving some injuries.<br/>
    	(set: $damageTaken = ($mobility + ($damage * 3)) / 50 * (random: 1,6))
 		 (if: $damageTaken > 5)[
      		(set: $bleedRate = $bleedRate + 1)
  		]
		(set: $health = $health - $damageTaken)
]
(if: $seeMetrics)[
	HP: $health <br/>
    Bleed Rate: $bleedRate <br/>
    Damage Taken: $damageTaken <br/>
]
(if: $health < 1)[
	You have lost too much blood. The world begins to grow faint as you feel a deep hunger grow... <br/>
    [[Game Over]]
] (else:)[
 	You managed to flee past them with your life. 
 	(if: $damageTaken)[
    	 You were not quite quick enough though and they gave you a few small injuries. 
    ] <br/>
 	(if: (random:0,100) < 33)[
    	You approach an intersection of hallways <br/>
        [[Turn Left]] <br/>
        [[Turn Right]] <br/>
 	]
    [[ Continue Straight]]  <br/>
    [[Enter a Nearby Room]]
]
}


:: Game Over {"position":"925,1600","size":"100,100"}



:: Go Down {"position":"800,1300","size":"100,100"}



:: Go Investigate {"position":"1025,500","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $karma = $karma - 10)
(set: $attack = $attack + 10)

You grab your electric bone saw and abandon the patient mid surgery. They likely will not survive if you don't get back quickly. 
<br/>
[[Enter the Hallway]]
}


:: Help Them {"position":"500,1125","size":"100,100"}
{
(set: $bleedRate = (max:0, $bleedRate - 3))
(set: $karma = (max:0, $karma - 15))
(set: $health = (min: 100, $health + 5))
(set: $health = $health - $bleedRate)
(set: $progress = $progress + 1)
(if: $seeMetrics)[
	HP: $health <br/>
    Bleed Rate: $bleedRate <br/>
    Attack Strength: $attack <br/>
    Mobility: $mobility <br/>
]
(if: $health < 1)[
	You have lost too much blood. The world begins to grow faint as you feel a deep hunger grow... <br/>
    [[Game Over]]
] (else:)[
	You use the supplies for yourself to slow your bleeding while the patient grows progressively weaker.. <br/>
    (if: (random:0,100) < 50)[
    	[[Return to The Hallway and Continue ->Enter the Hallway]] 
    ](else:)[
    	[[Return to The Hallway and Continue -> Continue Straight]] 
    ]
]
}


:: Turn Left {"position":"900,1200","size":"100,100"}



:: Turn Right {"position":"1125,1200","size":"100,100"}



